<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 364-day t-bill steady at 10.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 364-day t-bill steady at 10.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it maintained a cut-off price of 90.83 rupees at its fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 10.12 percent.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 39 bids for 5.12 billion rupees of which it accepted eight for 1.11 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off price worked out to 90.84 rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
